Automation of adding 150 – 500 User 
For 150+ users, I would not build this as a collection of small scripts. I would build it as a proper onboarding application that is:
•	Data-driven (CSV input) 
•	Idempotent (safe to rerun) 
•	Produces reports 
•	Logs everything 
•	Supports rollback/retries 
•	Can handle 150, 500, or 1000+ users 
